  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse rapide aux besoins imm&#xE9;diats des populations vuln&#xE9;rables en situation d&#x2019;ins&#xE9;curit&#xE9; alimentaire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide food security assistance to internally displaced persons and host community members in the Far North of Cameroon. This FAO project provides $490,000 directly to households in need through unconditional cash assistance and distributes agricultural inputs including seeds, live animals and animal feed. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 20,000 people, including 9,000 women, 6,000 men, 5,000 children, and including 4,600 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
